### Profile - Get all
GET http://localhost:3000/profile

### Profile - Get by id
GET http://localhost:3000/profile/1

### Profile - Create
POST http://localhost:3000/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "12345678",
  "mobile": "0841234567",
  "cardId": "1122334455667"
}

### Auth - Login (bcrypt compare)
POST http://localhost:3000/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "user1",
  "password": "12345678"
}
